17. Development Philosophy

TunnelOS is designed according to a simulation-first methodology.

Before deployment against physical machinery:

SIMULATED TBM
      ↓
SYNTHETIC TELEMETRY
      ↓
RUST PIPELINE
      ↓
PYTHON DIGITAL TWIN
      ↓
KOTLIN INTERFACE

This allows the architecture to be tested without creating a direct dependency on operational machinery.

Only subsequently should validated interfaces to real industrial environments be introduced.

